        {
          "text": "Hamashi ahimulambu wahanshidi kapristu akanonuhu namunu windi, akaloombi kunseŋu jakameŋa kahimulambu wakushita, nimashi indi ejima akayimwaŋili kwishina dakameŋa; ",
